OL,3,GNEWSADog destroyed after series of
OL,4,Asheep deaths
OL,5,
OL,6,FA dog suspected to have carried out a
OL,7,Fseries of fatal sheep attacks has been
OL,8,Fput down, police have said.
OL,10,FOn 20 September rural officers launched
OL,11,Fan investigation after at least 35
OL,12,Fsheep were killed and "dozens more"
OL,13,Fsuffered serious injuries in Mid Devon.
OL,15,FProviding an update on the
OL,16,Finvestigation, Devon and Cornwall
OL,17,FPolice said it was informed on 25
OL,18,FSeptember a dog was found to be
OL,19,Fattacking livestock had been "sadly
OL,20,Fdestroyed".
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
