OL,3,GNEWSADog destroyed after series of
OL,4,Asheep deaths
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe destroyed dog was believed to be
OL,7,Fthe same one responsible for other
OL,8,Fattacks in recent weeks, the force
OL,9,Fsaid.
